 'in part', $t$Written 10:41 CST 11-23 on the operator's card "Write 539 and 530" (W4 10726; audit 40044), on the post-539 engine: engine ae0f90de to daf5da98, child 334f0518 to 10624dd2, Shared Library lines 3057 and 3457 only, Library 5aedc2f2ac70ba66. Read back by W2 at Wall 10729 (MATCH); Library Check pair PASSES, map 8c1bc26d588f1fe1. Offline, every E-COL item of 41418 carries the block, the D5 vs C2 items carry Matthew 1:24, and the 152 enforced rows and the tally are equal (W4 10695, W2 10714). Whether the enforcer answers ENGAGE NO on the known bad is for the paid replay (separate card). Not yet shown by a run.$t$,
 '10633, 10634, 10636, 10662, 10663, 10666, 10669, 10672, 10675, 10676, 10677, 10678, 10679, 10695, 10714, 10726, 10729', 'session_01H1X3ANeXjt6pnw4fs6Wxr4', NULL,
